    "replaced": "A newer proposal for the same target replaced this one. Do not retry it.",
    "expired": "Nobody answered this proposal within 15 minutes, so it was withdrawn. Do not retry it unless the person asks again.",
    "changed": "Not run yet. The person answered: “{answer}”. If that changes the call, make the changed call once with the same tool, op and target: it runs without another card. Otherwise do what they said.",
